{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "18375ad900129501bbad4b4e4edbc32456c6f2af0307fcf58a46ebbb251b7ec0", "ja": "ロコアートをもっとプログレッシブにしたいんですけど\nなんだかうまくいかなくて、それで……。", "zh": "ROCO想让Rocoart更Progressive，\n可是一直不太顺利，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "af9ad7329b11f01433bc7a5c27c184841d4e1e1e8ce349100541a515acb3de2f", "ja": "あーもう、難しくて何言ってるかわかんないよ～。\nつーか、体を動かせばちょっとはスッキリするって♪", "zh": "啊──真是的，那么复杂的话我听不懂啦～\n我说啊，只要动一动身体，心情一定会比较舒畅喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "dc2afdb5e4b104aeba1b4f11131bf0c5aea71f75964bb3dfc07d0ef99c7a1113", "ja": "それじゃあ{$P$}、\nロコ借りてくぜ！　また後でな♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}，\nROCO我带走啰！等会见♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
