{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "682891a247a8398edb9bc65eef9e7be49c17944703d4f8f7ff0d65d38e710123", "ja": "は、はぁ、はぁ……ろ、ロコはもうダメです……。\nエネルギーが、ゼロになってしまいました……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……RO、ROCO不行了……\nEnergy已经掉到Zero了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
