{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "aff5b75390c43fb1cc5b43648281e50c30ec6ff7794f7c3a8bb3fc3b037a3967", "ja": "このくらいでバテてたら、公演のセンターどころか\n野球のセンターも務まらないぜ！　なんてな♪", "zh": "才这样就累瘫的话，不要说公演的Center了，\n连棒球的Center都当不了喔！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "a82fba5eb7cfda56cddbb1236b9b7c4ad6e8b1a64bfe593472705c27bd574c09", "ja": "べ、ベースボールは関係ないです！　……うぅ、\nロコはこんなことしてる場合じゃないのに～……。", "zh": "这、这和Baseball无关！\n呜呜……现在明明不是做这种事的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "498a07b1e0ca7821da9b912297c1036b367cb9a42be71d8fec5edb26088b9928", "ja": "ロコちゃん、お疲れのようですね～。\n練習の前に休憩した方がいいでしょうか～？", "zh": "ROCO，你好像很累呢～\n练习前要不要休息一下～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "bb7807a384b860d3f85c0899e135293cf555cf0a9de7f3de3fd8d8b69d981193", "ja": "いやいや、練習してないのに休憩って、\nなんかおかしくないか？", "zh": "不对吧，还没练习就休息，\n不觉得哪里怪怪的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1030_p", "source_sha256": "232a240dd3a6c8856401125bd5647a079c10bd4ca8871647ea70d8461332ef94", "ja": "（みんなとのレッスンで、ロコがセンターに\n前向きになればと思ったんだが、どうだろう……）", "zh": "（我本来以为，和大家一起练习可以让ROCO\n更积极地面对Center的责任，但看起来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_009_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "c02a9d30bf6427c100a913dcaf3837dc0e1fd2564d3d8fc2f485e3a7cd3ebcee", "ja": "うぅ……へ、ヘビーです……。スバルにもミヤにも、\nちっともついていけませんでした……。", "zh": "唔唔……身体好、好Heavy……不管昴还是美也，\nROCO都完全跟不上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
